<title>Taarini</title><link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io</link><description>Contemporary Indian resin jewellery: botanical drops, translucent hoops, marble bangles and flower anklets, designed in India for the way you dress now.</description>
<item><g:id>TAR-E01</g:id><title>Gulmohar Botanical Drops | Taarini</title><description>Clear teardrops holding a pressed scarlet gulmohar bloom, framed in gold-tone. Every May the gulmohar sets Indian streets alight. These drops keep that colour all year. A scarlet bloom with its streaked ivory flag petal floats in clear resin, with a little fern, a sprig of baby’s breath and a few flecks of gold leaf. A slim gold-tone frame outlines each teardrop. They hang from fine French ear wires, so they move easily and stay light.</description><link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/products/gulmohar-botanical-drops</link><g:image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/gulmohar-botanical-drops/product.jpg</g:image_link><g:additional_image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/gulmohar-botanical-drops/detail.webp</g:additional_image_link><g:additional_image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/gulmohar-botanical-drops/styled.webp</g:additional_image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>1149.00 INR</g:price><g:brand>Taarini</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:google_product_category>Apparel &amp; Accessories &gt; Jewelry &gt; Earrings</g:google_product_category><g:product_type>Earrings</g:product_type><g:color>Clear with scarlet and green</g:color><g:material>Resin</g:material><g:gender>female</g:gender><g:age_group>adult</g:age_group><g:shipping><g:country>IN</g:country><g:service>Standard</g:service><g:price>0.00 INR</g:price></g:shipping></item>
<item><g:id>TAR-E02</g:id><title>Amber Sandhya Hoops | Taarini</title><description>Chunky translucent hoops in the honey-gold of an Indian dusk. Sandhya is the hour when the light turns gold. These generous hoops are cast in translucent amber resin that glows when light passes through. Gold-tone end caps hold a slim hinged post. They read bold from across a room, but are much lighter than a metal hoop of the same size.</description><link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/products/amber-sandhya-hoops</link><g:image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/amber-sandhya-hoops/product.jpg</g:image_link><g:additional_image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/amber-sandhya-hoops/detail.webp</g:additional_image_link><g:additional_image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/amber-sandhya-hoops/styled.webp</g:additional_image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>899.00 INR</g:price><g:brand>Taarini</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:google_product_category>Apparel &amp; Accessories &gt; Jewelry &gt; Earrings</g:google_product_category><g:product_type>Earrings</g:product_type><g:color>Translucent amber</g:color><g:material>Resin</g:material><g:gender>female</g:gender><g:age_group>adult</g:age_group><g:shipping><g:country>IN</g:country><g:service>Standard</g:service><g:price>79.00 INR</g:price></g:shipping></item>
<item><g:id>TAR-E03</g:id><title>Gulabi Marble Sculpt Earrings | Taarini</title><description>Soft, pebble-like sculptures in pink and ivory marbled resin, on gold-tone studs. Gulabi means rosy. These are rounded, pillowy forms where rose and ivory swirl together, with the odd fine vein of gold. Because the colour is poured, the marbling on each piece is unique. They hang from flat gold-tone stud tops, so the sculpture sits just below the lobe.</description><link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/products/gulabi-marble-sculpt-earrings</link><g:image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/gulabi-marble-sculpt-earrings/product.jpg</g:image_link><g:additional_image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/gulabi-marble-sculpt-earrings/detail.webp</g:additional_image_link><g:additional_image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/gulabi-marble-sculpt-earrings/styled.webp</g:additional_image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>1049.00 INR</g:price><g:brand>Taarini</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:google_product_category>Apparel &amp; Accessories &gt; Jewelry &gt; Earrings</g:google_product_category><g:product_type>Earrings</g:product_type><g:color>Rose and ivory marble</g:color><g:material>Resin</g:material><g:gender>female</g:gender><g:age_group>adult</g:age_group><g:shipping><g:country>IN</g:country><g:service>Standard</g:service><g:price>0.00 INR</g:price></g:shipping></item>
<item><g:id>TAR-E04</g:id><title>Panna Geometric Studs | Taarini</title><description>Elongated emerald-green hexagons with a crisp gold-tone edge. Panna is the Hindi word for emerald. These small studs take the deep green of the stone and cut it into a long hexagon, edged in fine gold-tone, with a few flecks of gold leaf. They are made for every day: at the office, under a dupatta, or stacked with a second piercing.</description><link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/products/panna-geometric-studs</link><g:image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/panna-geometric-studs/product.jpg</g:image_link><g:additional_image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/panna-geometric-studs/detail.webp</g:additional_image_link><g:additional_image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/panna-geometric-studs/styled.webp</g:additional_image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>449.00 INR</g:price><g:brand>Taarini</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:google_product_category>Apparel &amp; Accessories &gt; Jewelry &gt; Earrings</g:google_product_category><g:product_type>Earrings</g:product_type><g:color>Emerald green</g:color><g:material>Resin</g:material><g:gender>female</g:gender><g:age_group>adult</g:age_group><g:shipping><g:country>IN</g:country><g:service>Standard</g:service><g:price>79.00 INR</g:price></g:shipping></item>
<item><g:id>TAR-E05</g:id><title>Rangoli Jhumka Earrings | Taarini</title><description>A contemporary jhumka with a painted-band resin bell, a flower top and a gold-tone bead fringe. The jhumka, with a lighter step. Each bell is cast in bands of maroon, saffron, teal and rose, like a rangoli at the threshold, with dotted borders and a fringe of small gold-tone beads. A resin flower stud sits at the top. The bell is semi-translucent, so the colours glow when light catches them.</description><link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/products/rangoli-jhumka-earrings</link><g:image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/rangoli-jhumka-earrings/product.jpg</g:image_link><g:additional_image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/rangoli-jhumka-earrings/detail.webp</g:additional_image_link><g:additional_image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/rangoli-jhumka-earrings/styled.webp</g:additional_image_link><g:availability>backorder</g:availability><g:availability_date>2026-11-08</g:availability_date><g:price>1299.00 INR</g:price><g:brand>Taarini</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:google_product_category>Apparel &amp; Accessories &gt; Jewelry &gt; Earrings</g:google_product_category><g:product_type>Earrings</g:product_type><g:color>Maroon, saffron, teal and rose</g:color><g:material>Resin</g:material><g:gender>female</g:gender><g:age_group>adult</g:age_group><g:shipping><g:country>IN</g:country><g:service>Standard</g:service><g:price>0.00 INR</g:price></g:shipping></item>
