<item><g:id>TAR-N03-40cm</g:id><g:item_group_id>TAR-N03</g:item_group_id><title>Jharokha Floral Pendant – Chain length 40 cm | Taarini</title><description>A Mughal-arch pendant in rose-tinted resin with a climbing floral vine. The jharokha is the overhanging arched window of Rajasthani and Mughal architecture. Here its pointed arch frames a climbing vine of rosebuds and leaves in soft rose-tinted resin. A gold-tone frame with a small finial at the top and two beads at the base completes the arch. It is our most architectural pendant, and our favourite.</description><link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/products/jharokha-floral-pendant</link><g:image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/jharokha-floral-pendant/product.jpg</g:image_link><g:additional_image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/jharokha-floral-pendant/detail.webp</g:additional_image_link><g:additional_image_link>https://purkaitswapnil-cpu.github.io/images/products/jharokha-floral-pendant/styled.webp</g:additional_image_link><g:availability>in_stock</g:availability><g:price>1499.00 INR</g:price><g:brand>Taarini</g:brand><g:condition>new</g:condition><g:identifier_exists>no</g:identifier_exists><g:google_product_category>Apparel &amp; Accessories &gt; Jewelry &gt; Necklaces</g:google_product_category><g:product_type>Necklaces</g:product_type><g:color>Blush rose with green</g:color><g:material>Resin</g:material><g:gender>female</g:gender><g:age_group>adult</g:age_group><g:size>40 cm</g:size><g:shipping><g:country>IN</g:country><g:service>Standard</g:service><g:price>0.00 INR</g:price></g:shipping></item>
